      <h2>Challenge</h2>
      <br>
      <br>
        <p>Junior NBA was looking for a primary vendor to manage its digital assets, maintain and strategise the website content and the Facebook pages in the regions of &#45; Indonesia, Malaysia, Philippines, Singapore, Thailand and Vietnam.</p><br />

        <p>They presented us with the challenge of creating a new generation of NBA fans by increasing fan acquisition and engagement among youth in the age groups of 10&#45;14 years old who are interested in basketball.</p><br />

        <p>We needed to make sure and convince them that we have the necessary skills and resources to provide high quality results.
        </p>

    </div>
