    <div class="about-content sm-top">
      <h2>My Role & Process</h2>
      <br>
      <br>
        <p>I was the head of research for the content department. My role was to gather content and statistics so that we could best represent the service that we can offer in order to maximise our opportunity of winning the business.</p><br />

        <p>After gathering the statistics, we decided the best way to represent it was through an infographic. As I have never done infographics before, I needed to research how best to construct it. I prioritised the statistics that I would use within the infographic and agreed on the tone of voice and imagery we wanted to show.</p><br />

        <p>My initial approach was to create sketches of the infographic layout, which I tested with my peers in the data and analytics department. Once I was happy with the content and the layout approach, I created a low-fidelity version of the infographic.</p>
    </div>
