      <h2>Solution</h2>
      <br>
      <br>
        <p>After I created the low-fi version, I went through a second round of testing to further validate my design approach. After a few tweaks to the content and layout, it was ready to apply the final visual look and feel.</p><br />

        <p>I laid out the statistics and figures for this demographic of fans (10-14 year olds) in a visually appealing manner to identify content opportunities: the level of sports consumption online, the most engaging type of sports content on social media, the most popular types of channels for sports discussion, and the most meaningful type of off-season content.</p>
